# Android Release

Adopt when configuring Android export, touch input, or build.

**Export:** min_sdk 24, target_sdk 34, landscape, immersive_mode, viewport 480×270.
**Joystick:** Bottom-left 25%, radius ~60px, dead zone 10%, semi-transparent.
**Targets:** FPS 60, RAM <200MB, APK <50MB, load <3s.
**Pre-release:** Signed, tested on 2 devices, 5 runs no crash, joystick comfortable.
